{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1170671-the-caul-and-lunar-society","id":1170671,"title":"The Caul and lunar society","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-12-26T07:39:10-08:00","id":1170671,"title":"The Caul and lunar society","content":"I\u2019m taking my players to the Caul. I\u2019m interested in all information you got, anyone written any non-canonical stuff? Homebrews etc?<br /> <br /> How does it affect lunar society? How do lunars and DB:s interract there? Is it just war or is there anything else to it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23638-lordabbadon","name":"lordabbadon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T07:58:12-08:00","id":1170675,"title":"","content":"It think it was said that the Caul was among other things a breadbasket for the Realm (at least one of them). That would require some lunar db interaction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T08:18:12-08:00","id":1170680,"title":"","content":"Well, we know that the Caul was where Gaia and Luna walked together, and shows both their influence to an extreme not seen in other places of Creation. It's a Holy Land for both Lunars and Dragonbloods, a place literally overflowing with the blessings of both of their patrons. And they have been warring for control of the place since the Usurpation. There is a Pilgrim path through five cities that Dragonbloods take that supposedly purifies their essence and strengthens their connection to the Dragons. But the Realm only controls the one City that has a port when the game starts. The rest is apparently controlled by a powerful Lunar Warlord. The Immaculate Order wants to take the Caul back, because of its religious significance and practical benefits of more powerful Dragonbloods taking the pilgrimage, but that would be yet another front opened up by an Empire already fighting on far too many.<br /> <br /> For Lunars, that Warlord is undoubtedly recruiting and would be a potential patron and mentor. It also gives a look at an openly Lunar empire unlike the sponsored threshold kingdoms like Halta. This one is under direct Lunar rule and is powerful enough to fight the Realm. So what would that look like? Are the conquered cities now filled with beastmen children? Terrified humans? People who have lived here and accept that their Masters have changed multiple times? Or are the cities beseiged and still loyal to the Realm while the Lunars only control the land between them?<br /> <br /> Further, the Caul is noted to be a land that is very nearly outright magical. I would say there are ruins there that predate humanity, artifacts made by Gaia or Luna for each other as lover's gifts, strange creatures both intelligent and not that are found nowhere else in the world, A massively varying climate as Elemental influence waxes and wanes in certain places, and the place should be literally covered in demesnes and ancient manses. Heck, I could see an argument that the entire subcontinent is just a single gigantic demesnes or manse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8807-galatine","name":"Galatine","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T13:26:24-08:00","id":1170756,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8807-galatine\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8807\" data-vbnamecard=\"8807\">Galatine</a> has me thinking that if creation is gaias body then it very well makes sense that the Caul is Gaia's heart both figuratively (where she and Luna resided together) and literally. Might be an interesting concept to play with","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8897-joshopotamus","name":"joshopotamus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T14:03:16-08:00","id":1170764,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Galatine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1170671-the-caul-and-lunar-society?p=1170680#post1170680\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">both of their patrons.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Dragon-Blooded are the Chosen of the Five Elemental Dragons, whom are the children of Gaia, but not part of Gaia. She is not their matron. The Dragons apparently had their own reasons for finding the island important.<br /> <br /> Gaia has as much to do with the Dragon-Blooded as she does the Lunar Exalted, now that apparently Gaia will be somewhat reflected in the Lunar Exalted, if only because Luna designed them that way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":636,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","user":"Sunder the Gold","date":". 12-26-2017, 05:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T14:16:10-08:00","id":1170769,"title":"","content":"In my game the setting is pretty much the one in 2.0 with the added locations from 3.0.<br /> <br /> I thinking about playing a couple of stories in the Caul, the Idea at the moment is basically that the Caul is Holy for the lunars, but they haven\u2019t colonized it in the way it\u2019s been done in 3.0. The DBs have their holy places, but are based in Walled Faikai. <br /> <br /> A great gathering will take place where elders such as Tamuz and Swims-In-Shadows will partake. The main topic will of course be the return of the solars, how to deal with IR, counter it etc.<br /> <br /> Since there\u2019s no lore surrounding Sha\u2019a Oka I\u2019m thinking about either removing him or making him something non-lunar(such as a Kami guardian of the Caul or something).<br /> <br /> The players will be instrumental in deciding if the Caul shold become a lunar nation such as for example the icewalkers under the Bull or the like, or if they should keep on with things as they are...<br /> <br /> My general concern is how to fit the Caul in with the rest of lunar society 2.0, it should be important but at the same time it shouldn\u2019t make the rest of Lunar society irrelevant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23638-lordabbadon","name":"lordabbadon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-27T11:16:41-08:00","id":1170999,"title":"","content":"I wrote a Manse set in the Caul, Asura, <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/12909723/chapters/29532801\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-27T14:24:35-08:00","id":1171057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>joshopotamus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1170671-the-caul-and-lunar-society?p=1170756#post1170756\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8807-galatine\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8807\" data-vbnamecard=\"8807\">Galatine</a> has me thinking that if creation is gaias body</div> </div> </div> </div>It is not, in fact. Gaia is somewhere else, and Creation is not her, her body, or her heart.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-27T14:37:40-08:00","id":1171061,"title":"","content":"Based on Vance's last words in the Ask thread, I'm not convinced that the Lunar Exalted HAVE a society, anymore.<br /> <br /> There might be a Lunar society on the Caul, but the Silver Pact is too loose to be considered a society.<br /> <br /> It's analogous to how &quot;the internet&quot; is not a society, even if there are societies within the internet. Like the internet, the Silver Pact is just a medium of exchanges.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-27T16:17:03-08:00","id":1171085,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1170671-the-caul-and-lunar-society?p=1171061#post1171061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Based on Vance's last words in the Ask thread, I'm not convinced that the Lunar Exalted HAVE a society, anymore.<br /> <br /> There might be a Lunar society on the Caul, but the Silver Pact is too loose to be considered a society.<br /> <br /> It's analogous to how &quot;the internet&quot; is not a society, even if there are societies within the internet. Like the internet, the Silver Pact is just a medium of exchanges.</div> </div> </div> </div>He explicitly referred to Lunar society in 2e not 3e so what Vance talks about in the Ask thread about the subject is probably inapplicable here. Although, to your point I'm not sure Lunars really had a cohesive society in 2e either.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-27T17:13:25-08:00","id":1171106,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1170671-the-caul-and-lunar-society?p=1171085#post1171085\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He explicitly referred to Lunar society in 2e not 3e</div> </div> </div> </div>What? When? I can't remember the last time 2nd Edition has come up in the Ask Devs thread.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-27T17:30:35-08:00","id":1171108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1170671-the-caul-and-lunar-society?p=1171106#post1171106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What? When? I can't remember the last time 2nd Edition has come up in the Ask Devs thread.</div> </div> </div> </div>The poster of this thread was talking about Lunar society in 2e, not 3e.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-27T19:51:22-08:00","id":1171137,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1170671-the-caul-and-lunar-society?p=1171085#post1171085\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> He explicitly referred to Lunar society in 2e not 3e so what Vance talks about in the Ask thread about the subject is probably inapplicable here. <b>Although, to your point I'm not sure Lunars really had a cohesive society in 2e either.</b></div> </div> </div> </div>The pain continues...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","user":"Saur Ops Specialist","date":". 12-27-2017, 10:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T04:54:55-08:00","id":1171204,"title":"","content":"Imhad one idea for the Lunars of the Caul, totally my own idea and not canon. In the book,it mentioned the Lunar leader Sha'a Oka goes a long time without being heard from, and recently started sending messages out calling fellow Lunars to the Caul for battle. My idea is what if the reason he wasnt heard from for a long time is he died, and now someone else is sending the call out in his name to get the Lunars into a drawn-out battle with the Dragon Blooded.<br /> <br /> you can take it from there<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1047,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","user":"vampire hunter D","date":".  I need to learn to type 12-29-2017, 12:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T05:29:20-08:00","id":1171208,"title":"","content":"What does Sha\u2019a Oka have against Australians?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12844-bladewind","name":"Bladewind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}